  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Willie Roy**: back after 218 archived shows (979 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Blue Mule**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **John Deere Tractor**: back after 267 archived shows (2048 days) [3]\n- **Southbound**: back after 127 archived shows (505 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Dealing Dispair**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Norwegian Wood**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2020-01-25.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 124 min [1]\n- **billystrings2020-01-25.litz.akg414.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 124 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2020-01-25.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY 250/5i>Schoeps VST62iu>Sound Devices MixPre-10 II (@32 BIT Float/48Khz) [1]. Also: Recorded and processed by Keith Litzenberger using Schoeps MK41v microphones with Schoeps KCY 250/5i and VST62iu preamp stages; Signal went into a Sound Devices MixPre-10 II at 32-bit float/48kHz, then was edited in Sound Forge Pro 13; Resampled and dithered to 16-bit/44.1kHz, tracked in CDWAV, and encoded to FLAC with Trader's Little Helper [1]\n- **billystrings2020-01-25.litz.akg414.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: AKG C414 XLS' (Hypercardioid)>Sound Devices MixPre-10 II (@32 BIT Float/48Khz) [2]. Also: Fed into a Sound Devices MixPre-10 II at 32-bit float/48kHz, then edited in Sound Forge Pro 13; Resampled and dithered to 16-bit/44.1kHz, tracked in CDWAV, and encoded to FLAC with Trader's Little Helper [2]",
